aside [drawer-aside] label="Workings"
  div [drawer:retention] label="Workings: signed_up → note_created retention · Retention insight · live"
    "Workings"
    "signed_up → note_created retention · Retention insight · live"
    div [drawer-changed] role=status
    button [workings-close] label="Close workings (W)"
      "Close"
    div [drawer-scroll]
      div [station:emit]
        div [station-dot]
        div [station-head]
          "Emit"
          "the event catalogue"
        button [station-toggle] label="Emit station"
        div [station-body]
          "signed_up"
          "is a Rust type in your app, so its properties are its fields and a misspelled one fails when it compiles. This is the shape the app last registered; the service doesn't record where in your code it's sent from."
          div [code]
            div [code-head]
              "Rust"
              button [copy] label="Copy as Rust"
                "Copy"
            div [code-line]
              "1"
              span [code-text]
                "#[derive(Event)]"
            div [code-line]
              "2"
              span [code-text]
                "struct"
                "SignedUp"
                "{"
            div [code-line]
              "3"
              span [code-text]
                "plan"
                ":"
                "String"
                ","
            div [code-line]
              "4"
              span [code-text]
                "source"
                ":"
                "String"
                ","
            div [code-line]
              "5"
              span [code-text]
                "}"
      div [station:send]
        div [station-dot]
        div [station-head]
          "Send"
          "the latest signed_up, re-encoded here"
        button [station-toggle] label="Send station"
        div [station-body]
          "Typed events send no property names, so this one is 77 bytes instead of 196: 60.7% smaller. Measured as one event alone in a batch; a real batch shares its context and session between events, so it shrinks further."
          div [code]
            div [code-head]
              button [copy] label="Copy as text"
                "Copy"
            div [code-line]
              "1"
              span [code-text]
                "typed"
                ","
                "positional"
                "77"
                "bytes"
            div [code-line]
              "2"
              span [code-text]
                "JSON"
                ","
                "named"
                "196"
                "bytes"
            div [code-line]
              "3"
              span [code-text]
            div [code-line]
              "4"
              span [code-text]
                "//"
                "values"
                "in"
                "field"
                "order"
                ":"
                "free"
                ","
                "pricing"
      div [station:store]
        div [station-dot]
        div [station-head]
          "Store"
          "events, person_distinct_ids, person_overrides on sqlite"
        button [station-toggle] label="Store station"
        div [station-body]
          "Events land in"
          "events"
          "as they arrive; sessions and persons are kept up to date beside them as each batch is stored, so a query reads tables, never a queue. These are the ones this query read."
          div [code]
            div [code-head]
              button [copy] label="Copy as text"
                "Copy"
            div [code-line]
              "1"
              span [code-text]
                "events"
            div [code-line]
              "2"
              span [code-text]
                "uuid"
                "BLOB"
            div [code-line]
              "3"
              span [code-text]
                "name"
                "TEXT"
            div [code-line]
              "4"
              span [code-text]
                "distinct_id"
                "TEXT"
            div [code-line]
              "5"
              span [code-text]
                "person_id"
                "BLOB"
            div [code-line]
              "6"
              span [code-text]
                "timestamp"
                "TEXT"
            div [code-line]
              "7"
              span [code-text]
                "received_at"
                "TEXT"
            div [code-line]
              "8"
              span [code-text]
                "session_id"
                "BLOB"
            div [code-line]
              "9"
              span [code-text]
                "context_id"
                "INTEGER"
            div [code-line]
              "10"
              span [code-text]
                "properties"
                "TEXT"
            div [code-line]
              "11"
              span [code-text]
                "source"
                "INTEGER"
            div [code-line]
              "12"
              span [code-text]
            div [code-line]
              "13"
              span [code-text]
                "person_distinct_ids"
            div [code-line]
              "14"
              span [code-text]
                "distinct_id"
                "TEXT"
            div [code-line]
              "15"
              span [code-text]
                "person_id"
                "BLOB"
            div [code-line]
              "16"
              span [code-text]
                "created_at"
                "TEXT"
            div [code-line]
              "17"
              span [code-text]
            div [code-line]
              "18"
              span [code-text]
                "person_overrides"
            div [code-line]
              "19"
              span [code-text]
                "distinct_id"
                "TEXT"
            div [code-line]
              "20"
              span [code-text]
                "person_id"
                "BLOB"
            div [code-line]
              "21"
              span [code-text]
                "created_at"
                "TEXT"
      div [station:ask]
        div [station-dot]
        div [station-head]
          "Ask"
          "the query"
        button [station-toggle] label="Ask station"
        div [station-body]
          "Every insight is one value of the typed"
          "Query"
          "enum. The SQL is what it became. It ran 2 statements on sqlite in <n> ms. Change the builder and these lines change with it."
          div role=tablist label="Ask as"
            button [ask-tab:rust] role=tab
              "Rust"
            button [ask-tab:sql] role=tab
              "SQL"
            button [ask-tab:http] role=tab
              "HTTP"
          div [ask-panel:rust] role=tabpanel
            div [code]
              div [code-head]
                "Rust"
                button [copy] label="Copy as Rust"
                  "Copy"
              div [code-line]
                "1"
                span [code-text]
                  "use"
                  "leptoskit_analytics"
                  ":"
                  ":"
                  "query"
                  ":"
                  ":"
                  "*;"
              div [code-line]
                "2"
                span [code-text]
              div [code-line]
                "3"
                span [code-text]
                  "let"
                  "query"
                  "="
                  "Query"
                  ":"
                  ":"
                  "Retention(RetentionQuery"
                  "{"
              div [code-line]
                "4"
                span [code-text]
                  "range"
                  ":"
                  "DateRange"
                  ":"
                  ":"
                  "between("
                  "\"2026-10-05T00:00:00Z\""
                  ","
                  "\"2026-11-02T00:00:00Z\""
                  ")"
                  ","
              div [code-line]
                "5"
                span [code-text]
                  "start_event"
                  ":"
                  "\"signed_up\""
                  ".into()"
                  ","
              div [code-line]
                "6"
                span [code-text]
                  "return_event"
                  ":"
                  "\"note_created\""
                  ".into()"
                  ","
              div [code-line]
                "7"
                span [code-text]
                  "kind"
                  ":"
                  "RetentionKind"
                  ":"
                  ":"
                  "FirstTime"
                  ","
              div [code-line]
                "8"
                span [code-text]
                  "period"
                  ":"
                  "Interval"
                  ":"
                  ":"
                  "Week"
                  ","
              div [code-line]
                "9"
                span [code-text]
                  "periods"
                  ":"
                  "None"
                  ","
              div [code-line]
                "10"
                span [code-text]
                  "filters"
                  ":"
                  "Vec"
                  ":"
                  ":"
                  "new()"
                  ","
              div [code-line]
                "11"
                span [code-text]
                  "test_accounts"
                  ":"
                  "None"
                  ","
              div [code-line]
                "12"
                span [code-text]
                  "}"
                  ");"
              div [code-line]
                "13"
                span [code-text]
              div [code-line]
                "14"
                span [code-text]
                  "//"
                  "From"
                  "the"
                  "app's"
                  "server"
                  ","
                  "as"
                  "the"
                  "app"
                  ":"
              div [code-line]
                "15"
                span [code-text]
                  "let"
                  "answer"
                  "="
                  "rpc"
                  ":"
                  ":"
                  "client"
                  ":"
                  ":"
                  "call_as_app(Run"
                  "{"
                  "query"
                  "}"
                  ").await?;"
          div [ask-panel:sql] role=tabpanel
            div [code]
              div [code-head]
