      div [station:draw]
        div [station-dot]
        div [station-head]
          "Draw"
          "rows → chart"
        button [station-toggle] label="Draw station"
        div [station-body]
          "4 cohorts came back, each a row of returns per week. A cell is that period's returns over the cohort's size, shaded in one hue so darker means more stayed; the top row is the mean, weighted by each cohort's size."
